<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Cannot have more puppets due to the puppet limit.-->
  <VPEP.CannotHaveMorePuppets>心偶数量已达上限。</VPEP.CannotHaveMorePuppets>
  <!--EN: It was caused by the Degrade psycast.-->
  <VPEP.DegradePsycast>这是受到了心智降格能力的影响。</VPEP.DegradePsycast>
  <!--EN: {Puppeteer_nameDef} has died. Before {Puppeteer_pronoun} died, {Puppeteer_pronoun} used the mind jump ability on {NewPuppeteer_nameDef}. Now {NewPuppeteer_nameDef} is a new puppeteer.-->
  <VPEP.MindJumpText>{Puppeteer_nameDef}已经死亡。但{Puppeteer_pronoun}临死之前将意识转移到了{NewPuppeteer_nameDef}身上。现在{NewPuppeteer_nameDef}是操偶师本尊了。</VPEP.MindJumpText>
  <!--EN: Mind jump-->
  <VPEP.MindJumpTitle>意识转移</VPEP.MindJumpTitle>
  <!--EN: No puppets.-->
  <VPEP.NoPuppets>没有心偶。</VPEP.NoPuppets>
  <!--EN: Puppets-->
  <VPEP.Puppets>心偶</VPEP.Puppets>
  <!--EN: A puppeteer can only sustain a puppet if there is enough psychic capacity to do so. Gain more psychic capacity to sustain more puppets by casting mind split, however bear in mind it will send the puppeteer and all their puppets into a {0} coma.\n\nPsychic capacity: {1}-->
  <VPEP.PuppetsGizmoTip>心偶师只有在有足够的心灵能力的情况下才能维持心偶。通过施放心灵分裂来获得更多的心灵能力来维持更多的心偶，但请记住，这会让心偶师和他们的所有心偶陷入 {0} 昏迷。\n\n心灵能力：{1}</VPEP.PuppetsGizmoTip>
  <!--EN: Current puppets:-->
  <VPEP.PuppetsUsage>当前心偶：</VPEP.PuppetsUsage>
  <!--EN: Target cannot be colonist.-->
  <VPEP.TargetCannotBeSameFactionAsCaster>不能选择己方成员。</VPEP.TargetCannotBeSameFactionAsCaster>
  <!--EN: Target is a puppet already.-->
  <VPEP.TargetIsPuppetAlready>目标已经是心偶了。</VPEP.TargetIsPuppetAlready>
  <!--EN: Target must be prisoner or slave.-->
  <VPEP.TargetMustBePrisonerOrSlave>目标必须是囚犯或奴隶。</VPEP.TargetMustBePrisonerOrSlave>
  <!--EN: Target must be a puppet of the caster.-->
  <VPEP.TargetMustBePuppetOfCaster>目标必须是属于施放者的心偶。</VPEP.TargetMustBePuppetOfCaster>
  <!--EN: Target must be prisoner or colonist.-->
  <VPEP.TargetMustBeSameFactionAsCaster>目标必须是殖民者或囚犯。</VPEP.TargetMustBeSameFactionAsCaster>
  <!--EN: Target must have brain leech from the caster.-->
  <VPEP.TargetMustHaveBrainLeech>目标必须拥有来自施放者的附脑蛊。</VPEP.TargetMustHaveBrainLeech>
</LanguageData>
